@startuml Finance Officer CSV Upload Sequence

title Finance Officer - CSV Upload & Process Flow

actor "Finance Officer" as FO
participant "Dashboard UI" as UI
participant "File Reader" as FR
participant "CSV Parser" as Parser
participant "Backend API\n(Coming Soon)" as API
database "Database" as DB

== CSV Upload ==
FO -> UI: Click "Upload CSV" button
UI -> FO: Open file selector
FO -> UI: Select CSV file
UI -> UI: Validate file type (.csv)
UI -> UI: Display file name & size

== CSV Processing ==
FO -> UI: Click "Proceed" button
UI -> UI: Set processing state
UI -> FR: Read CSV file
FR -> Parser: Parse CSV text
Parser -> Parser: Extract headers (row 1)
Parser -> Parser: Convert rows to JSON objects
Parser -> UI: Return JSON array
UI -> UI: Display JSON output

== Send to Backend (Future) ==
FO -> UI: Click "Send" button
note right of UI
  Currently logs placeholder message:
  "Ready to send JSON to backend 
  (API coming soon)"
end note

UI -> API: POST /api/stipend/import\n{jsonData}
activate API
API -> API: Validate JSON structure
API -> API: Check student IDs exist
API -> DB: Update stipend records
DB --> API: Confirmation
API --> UI: Success response
deactivate API
UI -> FO: Show success message

== Cancel/Reset ==
FO -> UI: Click "Cancel" or "Close Preview"
UI -> UI: Clear file selection
UI -> UI: Reset CSV data
UI -> UI: Reset to initial state

@enduml
